* The errors of an FD file and its prototypes in bad_protos.h
##base _BadBase
##bias 30
##public
BadAdd(a,b)(d0,d1)
* No prototype in the clib file
BadMissing(x)(d0)
* Fewer arguments in the prototype than in the FD file
BadShort(a,b)(d0,d1)
* More registers than arguments
BadRegs(a)(d0,d1)
* Not a register
BadReg(a)(d8)
This is not an FD line
##private
* No prototype is fine for a private function
BadPrivate(a)(d0)
##end
